// blade/view: a template's compiled view as a guest document (decision 0235).
//
// The PHP main compiles a Blade template to (`embedded: compiled-view`), written by main's view builder and placed
// at the Blade construct each of its tokens stands for, as vue/view.rr's Vue view is:
//   guest(g, file, root, "php")   g is the compiled view; host_node(n, h): the Blade node n stands for
embed(d, r, "compiled-view", "program") :- doc_role(d, "primary"), doc_root(d, r).
